text:
{
  "flores_passage": "Is sargarmi ko dekh kar, aabaad kaaron ne kumuk mangwayi thi. Colonel John Stark aur James Reed (baad azan donon generals muntakhab huye) ki sarbarahi mein, agli positions par muqami daston mein, 200 jawanon par mushtamil pehli aur teesri New Hampshire regiments shamil theen. Stark ke aadmiyon ne colonist ki jagah ki shumali had ke janglay par positions sambhaal lein. Jab jazeera numa ke shumal mashriqi hissay ke saath Mystic dariya ke saath nasheebi lehar ne aik khala ko khol diya, unhon ne jaldi jaldi aik patthar ki chhoti deewar se janglay ko shumal ki jaanib wasee kiya jo aik chhotay saahil par paani ke kinaare khatm hota tha. Gridley ya Stark ne janglay ke saamne taqreeban 100 foot (30 meter) ka khamba laga diya aur hukm diya ke jab tak aam size ki ashiya is se nahin guzar jaati koi fire nahin karega-"
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Bahut se logon ka mushahida hai ke felyaat aur bartao mein taal aksar darooni chakkar aur hayatiyati clocks ke zariye un ki paidawar ki maujoodgi par munhasir karti hai. Aise mutawatir taal jo mahaz kisi berooni mutawatir ishaare ka rad-e-amal nahin hote hain, jaraaseem, fungi, paudon aur jaanwaron samet beshtar jandaron ke liye zikr kiye gaye hain. Hayatiyati clocks khud ko barqaraar rakhne wala artaashinda hai jo khaarji ishaaron ki adam maujoodgi mein bhi azadi se chal rahe chakkar ki muddat ko jaari rakhe ga."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Nau-e-bashar ab tak ki sab se zyada zaheen makhlooq hai jo doosron ke zehan ko parh sakti hai. Is ka matlab yeh ke hum is qabil hain ke peshgoi kar sakein ke doosre insaan kya darak karte, kya niyat karte, kya aqeedah rakhte, kya jaante aur kya chahte hain. Un salahiyaton mein doosre ki niyat ko samjhna ahem hai. Yeh jismani aamaal ke mumkina abhamaon ko hal karne mein madad karti hai. Maslan agar aap kisi shakhs ko car ka sheesha tortay huye dekhte hain, to aap yahi farz karenge ke woh kisi ajnabi ki car chori karne ki koshish kar raha hai - hamein uske alag tarah se sochna hoga ke shayad un ki gaari ki kunji kho gayi hai aur yeh uski apni hi car thi jise woh torne ki koshish kar raha tha -"
}

{
  "flores_passage": "DNA ko jinyati maadah batane ke talluq se Hershey aur Chase ka tajurba sab se ahem tha. Hershey aur Chase ne aik bacteria mein apne DNA ki pewand kari karne ke liye, jaraaseem khoron, ya viruses ka istemaal kiya. Unhon ne do tajrubat kiye, ya to radioactive phosphorus se phage ka DNA banane ke liye ya radioactive sulfur se phage ka protein banane ke liye."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Haadse ke shikaar fard ki jaanch se pehle apni hifaazat ke liye jaaye haadsa ka jaayeza lein. Jab aap is mard ya aurat ke paas ya kisi un-chaahe khatre ke paas jaayein to aap ke liye mutaassirah ki haisiyat ko dekhna zaroori hai. Agar aap ko madad karne ki koshish karte huye takleef pahunchti hai, to aap muamlaat ko mazeed kharaab kar sakte hain."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Science daanon ka khaas hadaf scientific tareeqay se yeh maaloom karna hai ke duniya kaise kaam karti hai. Dar-asal yahi beshtar scienci tahqeeqaat ki rahnumayi karta hai. Yeh akele kaafi nahin, tajreeb ya tajurba woh test ya ikhtiyar hai jis ke zariye aik ya zaayed mafrozat ko rad kiya jaata hai, sawalaat tashkeel diye jaate hain, mushahidaat ke indraaj se bhi scienci research mein rahnumayi milti hai."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Deegar haiwanat-e-raeesa ke barkhilaf, hominids ab apne hathon ko harkat karne, wazan uthane ya darakhton mein jhoolne ke liye istemaal nahi karte. Chimpanzee ke haath paon hajam aur lambai mein yaksaan hote hain aur is ki bina par jab woh pichhle panjay par chalta hai to haath mein bojh utha sakta hai. Insaani haath paon se chhota hai, seedhe hathon aur pairon ki ungliyon ki chhoti haddiyon ke saath. Do se teen million saal purani rikazi haath ki haddiyan naqal-o-harkat se baratne ke saleeqay ki haath ki khusoosiyat mein yeh tabdeeli zahir karti hain."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Romanwiyat mein saqafati azm ka aik bahut bada unsur hota hai, jo Goethe, Gottlieb Fichte aur Schlegel jaise qalamkaron se akhaz kiya gaya hai. Romanwiyat ke tanazur mein, jughrafiye ne afraad ko dhala aur waqt guzarne ke saath riwayaat aur saqafat jo us jughrafiye se mutaliq thay, aur woh, muashre ki jagah ke saath ham-aahang thay, woh tasfiyana laagoo qawaneen ki nisbat zyada behtar thay."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Muaashi zaraat aisi zaraat hoti hai jo mahaz kasht kaar aur us ke ahle khana ki zarooriyaat ko poora karne ki had tak khuraak faraham karne ke liye ki jaati hai. Mustahkam zaraat saadah, aksar naamiyaati hoti hai, fasal ko baari baari uganay ya deegar nisbatan aasaan taraakeeb ke saath mil kar maahooliati nizaam ke muqaami mahfooz kardah beej ka istemaal karte huye nizaam zyada se zyada paidawar haasil karta hai. Taareekhi taur par zyada tar kisan rozi roti ke liye zaraat mein masroof hote thay aur ab bhi bahut se taraqqi pazeer mulkon mein yahi haal hai."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Laalach aur be-loosi hamesha hamare saath rahen ge aur yeh taawun ka khaasa hai ke jahan aksariyat faiz-yaab hoti hai wahin mukhtasar meyaad mein khud-gharzi se kaam karke hamesha zyada faayeda uthaya jaye ga. Umeed hai ke zyada-tar log mehsoos karenge ke un ka taweel-mudti behtareen ikhteyaar doosron ke saath mil kar kaam karna hai."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Sab se pehli naqal-o-harkat paidal chalna thi, insaanon ne Homo erectus (yaani seedha khada aadmi) ke namoodaar hone ke saath hi do million saal pehle seedha paidal chalna shuroo kar diya. Un ke pesh-rau, Australopithecus (junoobi manas) aadatan seedha nahin chalte the. Australopithecus fossils mein do qadmon par chalne ki takhassaat 4.2-3.9 million saal pehle se paayi jaati hain, jabke Sahelanthropus shayad saat million saal pehle hi donon qadmon par chal pada tha."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "\"Ji haan! Shah Tutankhamun ko kabhi kabhi \"\"Shah Tut\"\" ya \"\"Boy King\"\" ke taur par yaad kiya jaata hai, woh jadeed daur ke sab se zyada maaroof qadeem Misri baadshaahon mein se aik hain. Dilchasp taur par, qadeem zamano mein ise zyada aham nahin gardana jaata tha aur qadeem daur ke zyada tar baadshaahon ki fehrist mein is ka zikr nahin milta. Taaham 1922 mein is ke maqbaray ke inkishaaf ke baad woh mashhoor shakhsiyat ho gaya. Jab ke maazi mein bahut se maqbaray loot liye gaye, yeh maqbarah dast-burd se mahfooz raha. Tutankhamun ke saath madfoon tamaam ashiya ko mahfooz kar liya gaya hai, jin mein qeemti dhaaton aur nayaab pattharon se banaye gaye hazaaron fan-paaray shaamil hain.\""
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Mashriq-e-Wusta ke garam mahol mein ghar itne ahem nahin thay. Zyada tar Nasrani family khuli hawa mein raha karti thi. Peechhay ke hissay mein auratein khana pakati theen. Store sadak ki janib khulne wala aik khula counter tha. Makanat ki tameer pattharon se hoti thi. Canaan ki zameen par koi bada jangal nahin tha is liye lakri bahut zyada mehngi thi."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Halanke romiyon ke khaane hamare liye manoos hain lekin un ki daawaton mein baaz ajeeb-o-ghareeb ashiya bhi hoti theen maslan jungli soor, mor, seekh par, aur niola. Aik aur farq yeh tha ke jahan ghareeb afraad aur khwateen apna khana kursiyon par baith kar khaate the, wahin umra ko mil kar aisi ziyafat ka ehtimam pasand tha jahan woh khana khaate huye karwat ke bal lait payen. Qadeem Yunan ke dastarkhwan par woh ghizayein shamil ho nahin sakti theen jo baad ki sadiyon mein America se Europe mein ya Asia se aayin. Misaal ke taur par un ke paas na to makai thi, na tamatar, na aaloo, na cocoa tha aur na hi kisi qadeem Romi ne kabhi feel murgh ka maza liya tha."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Ashiya ki naqal-o-hamal ke liye bahri jahaazon ka istemaal samundron mein logon ki badi taadaad aur ashiya muntaqil karne ka ab tak ka sab se kaaraamd tareeqa hai. Navy ka riwaayati kaam is baat ko yaqini banana hai ke aap ka mulk apne logon aur saaz-o-saamaan ki naqal-o-hamal ki salahiyat ko barqaraar rakh paaye, jabke isi asnaa mein, aap ke dushman ki jaanib se apne logon aur saaz-o-saamaan ki naqal-o-hamal ki salahiyat mein rakhna bhi daal sake. Is ki sab se zyada qaabil-e-zikr haaliya misaalon mein se aik thi doosri aalami jung mein shumaali Atlantic ki muhim. Americi, Bartaniya ki madad ke liye Atlantic samandar ke paar afraad aur saaz-o-saamaan bhejne ki koshish kar rahe the. Baaeen haal German bahriya beshtar U-boats ko istemaal karke is traffic ko rokne ki koshish kar rahi thi. Agar ittehadi naakaam ho jaate to ghaliban Germany, Bartaniya par qaabiz ho jaata jaisa ke is ne baaqi Europe par qabza kiya tha."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Danelaw par dobara ghalib aane ke baad Bartaniya mein aik taweel arse tak aman qaayim raha. Taaham, sun 991 mein Ethelred ko aik sadi qabl Guthrum ke baad aik bahut bade Viking bairay ka samna karna pada tha. Is bairay ki qiyadat Norway ke baashinde Olaf Tryggvason ne ki, jo apne mulk ko Denmark ke tasallut se wagzaar karne ke azaayem rakhta hai. Ibtidai fauji dhachkay ke baad Ethelred Olaf ke saath muahide par raazi ho gaya jo makhloot kaamiyabi ke saath apni sultanat ko haasil karne ki koshish ke liye Norway waapas aaya."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Taiwan ne apni shuruaat 15win sadi mein ki thi jahan se guzarte huye europi mallahon ne is jazeere ka naam Ilha Formosa yaani khoobsoorat jazeere ke taur par darj kiya tha. 1624 mein Dutch East India Company ne junoob maghribi Taiwan mein aik base qaim kiya, aur desi anaaj paidawar ke tareeqon mein tabdeeli ka aaghaz kiya aur cheeni mazdooron ko apne chawal aur cheeni plantation mein kaam par lagaya. 1683 mein Qing sultanat ki afwaaj (1644-1912) ne Taiwan ke maghribi aur mashriqi saahili ilaaqe par qabza kar liya aur 1885 mein Taiwan ko Qing sultanat ka aik sooba qaraar diya. 1895 mein, pehli China-Japan jung (1894-1895) mein shikast ke baad, Qing hukumat ne Shimonoseki muahide par dastakhat kiye, jis ke bamujib is ne Taiwan par apne iqtedaar se Japan ke haq mein dastbardari ka aitraaf kiya, jis ne is jazeere par 1945 tak hukumat ki."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Hindi kitne log bolte hain is ke andaze alag alag hain- aik andaze ke mutabiq yeh duniya mein aam taur par doosri aur chauthi ke darmiyan sab se zyada boli jaane wali zabaan hai- is zabaan ko bolne walon ki tadaad mein tafaawut is par munhasir hai ke qareebi taur se baaham marboot lehjon ki ginti ki jaati hai ya nahin. Andaza hai ke bolne walon ki tadaad 340 million se 500 million ke darmiyan hai, aur taqreeban 800 million log is zabaan ko samajh sakte hain- zakheera-e-alfaaz ke lihaaz se Hindi aur Urdu yaksaan hain lekin tarz-e-tahreer judaagaana hai; rozmarra ki baat cheet mein, donon zabaanon ke bolne wale aik doosre ko achi tarah samajh sakte hain."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Sitaare roshni aur hararat is energy ki wajah se kharij karte hain jo hydrogen ke zarrat ke inzimam se saqeel anasir ki takhleeq se banti hai. Science daan aik aisa reactor bana rahe hain jo isi tareeqay se kaar kare ga. Halankeh, is maslay ko hal karna bahut mushkil hai aur hamein mufeed fusion reactors ki tameer kayi saalon baad dekhne ko mile gi."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Agarche pattharon se ahraam ki taameer ka silsila qadeem sultanat ke khaatma tak jaari raha lekin Giza mein taameer huye ahraam ka un ke hajam aur taameer ki khoobi ke lihaaz se koi jawaab nahin. Nayi sultanat ke qadeem Misri apne aaba-o-ajdaad ki yaadgaaron par hairat zada rehte the, jo us waqt bhi hazaar saal purani theen."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Ihtifalaat ka iftitah aalami shohrat yafta giroh Cirque du Soleil ke aik khaas show se hua. Is ke baad Istanbul State Symphony Orchestra, Janissary band aur gulukaaron Fatih Erkoç aur Müslüm Gürses ke program huye. Phir naachne waale malang stage par pahunch gaye. Turki saahra Sezen Aksu ne atalwi tenor Alessandro Safina aur yunani gulukaar Haris Alexiou ke saath apne fan ka muzahira kiya. Aakhir mein, Turki ke raqqas group Fire of Anatolia ne \"Troy\" show ka muzahira kiya."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Taaza tareen khabron ke mutabiq, samundari satah ke aedaad-o-shumaar ne nishandahi ki ke aik tsunami ban gaya tha. Pago Pago aur Niue ke qareeb kuch waazeh tsunami sargarmi maujood thi. Tonga mein koi bada nuqsaan ya chot ki khabar nahin aayi lekin aarzi taur par bijli chali gayi thi, jis ke ba'is mubaiyana taur par PTWC ke zariye jaari hone wali tsunami warning Tongai hukaam moosool nahin kar paaye. Saahili khitton par ya is ke qareeb waaqe Hawaii ke chaudah school, tanbeehaat ke uthaye jaane ke bawajood, budh ko poora din band thay."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Peer ko shaam 10:08 baje maghribi Montana ko aik darmiyanay darjay ke zalzalay ne hila kar rakh diya. Americi arziyati survey (USGS) aur is ke qaumi zalzala information centre ki taraf se kisi nuqsaan ki koi fauri ittela mosool nahin hui hai. Zalzalay ka markaz shumal mashriq Dillon ke shumal se taqreeban 20 kilometer (15 meel), aur Butte se taqreeban 65 kilometer (40 meel) junoob tha."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Band ne Maui ke War Memorial Stadium ke show ko mansookh kardiya, jis mein 9,000 log shirkat karne wale the, aur maddahon se maafi maang li. Band ki intezami company, HK Management Inc., ne koi ibtidai wajah nahin batayi jab unhon ne 20 sitambar ko mansookh kiya, magar unhon ne agle din tak mantaqi wajoohaat ko zimmedar thehraya."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Amsterdam shahar aur Anne Frank museum ke afsaron ka kehna hai ke darakht mein phaphond lagne se sehat-e-aama ko khatra lahaq ho gaya hai aur un ka daawa hai ke woh darakht girne ke qareeb hai. Is ko mangal ke din kaatne ka waqt tay kiya gaya tha, lekin adaalat ke hangaami faislay ke baad yeh bach gaya."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Moon ki kashish mujhe kaise kheench sakti hai? Agar tum moon ki satah par khade ho to tumhara wazan zameen par tumhare wazan se kam ho ga. Aik shakhs jis ka zameen par wazan taqreeban 200 pounds (90 kilogram) hai uska moon par wazan taqreeban 36 pounds (16 kilogram) hoga - lehaza kashish-e-saqal aapko yaqeenan kam kheenchti hai -"
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Maujoodah senator aur Argentina ki khatoon-e-awwal Cristina Fernandez de Kirchner ne guzishta shaam ko La Plata, jo Buenos Aires se 50 kilometer door (31 meel) aik shahar hai, us mein apni sadarati umeedwari ka ailaan kardiya. Mrs. Kirchner ne sadaarat ke liye kharay hone ka ailaan Argentina Theater se kiya. Yeh wohi muqaam tha jahan se us ne Buenos Aires soobay ke delegation ke rukn ki haisiyat se 2005 mein Senate ke liye apni muhim ka aaghaaz kiya tha."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "\"Do bade bachon ke walid shadi shuda Dual ke ne Miller ko bahut zyada mutaassir nahin kiya, jin ke taalluq se yeh kahani thi. Jab un se apni raaye poochi gayi, to Miller ne kaha, \"\"Samaat ke dauraan Mike bahut zyada baat karta hai... main taiyaar ho raha tha, is liye main waaqayi nahin sun paya ke woh kya keh raha tha.\"\"\""
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Bali mein deegar agenday mein duniya ke baaqi maandah janglaat ka tahaffuz, aur kam aaloodgi ke tareeqe se taraqqi karne ke liye taraqqi pazeer mamaalik ke saath technologies ka ishtiraaq karne ka mauzoo shaamil kiya gaya. Aqwaame Muttahida bhi umeed karta hai ke global warming se mutaassarah mamaalik ki madad ke liye aik fund ko hatmi shakl di jaye taake woh mamaalik is ke asraat se nimat sakein. Yeh raqoom flood-proof makaanaat, aab rasani ke behtar nizaam, aur faslon ki tanweea par sirf ki jaye gi."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "\"Medical charity Mangola, Medicines Sans Frontieres aur aalami idara-e-sehat ka kehna hai ke yeh mulk mein sab se shadeed phailao hai. Medicines Sans Frontieres ke tarjuman Richard Veerman ne kaha: \"Angola bimari ke apne sab se badtareen phailao ki taraf gaamzan hai aur Angola mein soorat-e-haal bahut kharab hai\"."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Agarche teen afraad ghar ke andar the jab car is se takrai lekin koi bhi zakhmi nahi hua. Taham, driver ko sar mein gehri chot aayi hai. Jis sadak par haadsa pesh aaya woh aarzi taur par band thi jab ke hangami khidmat ke tehat driver ko surkh Audi TT se nikala gaya tha. Shuru mein unhein Great Yarmouth mein James Paget Hospital mein daakhil karaya gaya tha. Baad mein use Cambridge ke Addenbrooke's Hospital mein muntaqil kar diya gaya."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "\"Haadsa hone ke baad, Gibson ko aik haspataal tak pahunchaya gaya magar woh kuchh der baad hi mar gaya. 64 saala truck driver ko is tasaadum ke dauraan koi chot nahin aayi thi. Jaaye haadsa se isi din taqreeban 1200 GMT par gaadi hi hata li gayi thi. Aik aadmi ne kaha jo ke qareebi aik garage mein kaam karta hai jahan yeh haadsa pesh aaya, \"\"Bachche sadak paar karne ka intezar kar rahe thay aur woh saaray cheekh aur ro rahe thay.\"\" Jaaye haadsa se woh sab wapas bhaag gaye.\""
}

{
  "flores_passage": "\"Is bahas ka ba-is Katrina toofan ke uqub mein imdaad aur baz-taameer par huye masaarif ki baabat tanaza tha; jise baaz maaliyati qadamat pasandon ne mazahan \"Bush ki New Orleans deal\" ka unwaan diya. Taameer-e-nau ki koshish par aazadana nuqta-e-cheeni ka markaz Washington mein basne wale mulaazmeen ko taameer-e-nau ke theke dene par hai.\""
}

{
  "flores_passage": "\"Television par barah-e-rast pehli dafa yeh tabsara ke aik ahem Irani zaraye ne yeh qubool kiya ke manzoori ke asraat hain. In mein iqtesadi pabandiyan aur Europi Union ki janib se kham tel ki bar-aamad par pabandi shamil hai, jis se Irani maeeshat ko is ki ghair mulki aamdani ka 80% hasil hota hai. Apni sab se haliya mahana report mein, OPEC ne bataya tha ke kham tel ki bar-aamdat 2.8 million barrels fi din ke hisab se do dahaiyon mein apni kam tareen satah par gir chuki hain. Mulk ke Supreme Leader, Ayatollah Ali Khamenei ne 1979 mein Iran ke Islami inqilab se pehle ke tel par inhesar ko \"aik jaal\" qarar diya hai aur kaha ke mulk ko is se khud ko azad karana hoga.\""
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Morrikheen ne agency ki sharah-e-kaamyabi ko mehmeez dene ki niyat se wasail ko aasani se hal hone wale mawaqe, bataur khaas chori ki gayi kaaron ke mawaqe par murtakiz karne ke liye FBI ki maazi ki policiyon par tanqeed ki hai. Congress ne maali saal 2005 mein fahaashi rokne ke iqdamaat ki maali iaanat shuru ki aur wazeh kiya ke FBI ko apne 10 kaarindon ko baalighon ki fahash nigari rokne ke liye waqf karna pade ga."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Hesperonychus elizabethae is dromaeosaurid khandan ki nau aur Velociraptor ka member hai. Mukammal pankh wale, aur garam khoon rakhne wale is shikari parinde ke bare mein khayal kiya jata hai ke yeh chhote dinosaur Velociraptor ki tarah apne do pairon par panjon ke sahare seedhe chalta hai. Is ka doosra panja nisbatan bada tha, jo ke Hesperonychus naam ki maqbooliyat ka ba'is bana jis ka matlab “maghribi panja” hota hai."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Reports ke mutabiq, gas ke risao ke baais Macbeth Street par aik apartment mein dhamaka hua hai. Aik parosi ki taraf se phone ke zariye gas leak hone ki khabar dene ke baad, gas company ka aik ahalkaar jaaye haadsa se ittela de raha tha. Jab ahalkaar pahuncha, to apartment mein dhamaka ho gaya. Kisi ke zyada zakhmi hone ki ittela nahin thi, lekin dhamake ke waqt jaaye waqoo par maujood kam az kam paanch afraad ka sadme ki alamaat ke liye ilaaj kiya gaya tha. Apartment ke andar koi maujood nahin tha. Is waqt qareeb 100 rihayish pazeer logon ko ilaaqe se nikaal liya gaya."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Peshengoi karne walon ne kaha hai ke toofan jo Cape Verde jazeeron ke maghrib mein taqreeban 645 meel (1040 kilometer) par waqay hai, aur imkaan hai ke woh zameeni ilaaqon ko nuqsaan pohanchane se pehle hi kamzor par jaye ga. Fred ko 105 meel fi ghanta (165 kilometer fi ghanta) ki hawaon ka samna hai aur woh shumal maghrib ki janib safar kar raha hai. Fred, junoob mashriqi behr-e-oqiyanoos mein satellite ke zariye tasweer kushi ke aaghaz ke baad ab tak ka sab se mazboot istiwai toofan hai, aur yeh 35° W ke mashriq mein ab tak ke record ka teesra bara samundari toofan hai."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "\"ANSA ke mutabiq police ko chand zor daar zarb ki wajah se tashweesh lahaq thi ke kahin yeh aik musalsal jung ki chingari na sulga de. Police ka kehna hai ke Lo Piccolo ko hi bartari hasil thi kyonke woh Palermo mein Provenzano ka daayaan haath shumaar hota tha aur us ke tajurbe zyada hone ke sabab use apne purane aaqaon ka ehtram hasil tha kyonke unhon ne apne power network ko mazboot banane ke dauran Provenzano ki policy 'kam se kam rakhne' par amal kiya. Provenzano ke zariye un maalikan par qabu paya gaya tha jab us ne riyasat ke khilaaf Riina ki taraf se chalaye jaane wali jung ka khatma kiya aur 1992 mein Mafia ke saleebi Giovanni Falcone aur Paolo Borsellino ko halak karne ka dawa kiya tha.\""
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Apne daure ke dauran Iwasaki ko kayi dafa mushkilat ka samna karna para. Ise bahri qazzaqon ne loot liya, ek dabang kutte ne Tibet mein is par hamla kiya, Nepal mein shadi karne se bach gaya aur Hindustan mein ise giraftar kar liya gaya."
}

{
