{
  "flores_passage": "\"Felicia, jo Saffir-Simpson hurricane scale par category 4 ka toofan hai, zail hone se pehle tropical depression mein tahleel ho gaya. Is ki baaqiyat se beshtar jazeeron mein barish hui hai, halanke abhi tak, is se kisi qism ke nuqsaan ya sailaab ki ittela nahin hai. Oahu mein aik gauge ki paimayish karne par 6.34 inch tak pahunchne waali barish ko \"faayeda mand\" bataya gaya tha. Kuchh barish ke saath garaj aur bijli ki kadak bhi thi.\""
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Northern Rock bank ko 2008 mein is inkeshaf ke baad qaumi milkiyat mein liya gaya ke company ne UK government se emergency support hasil ki. 2007 ke dauran sub-prime qarza jaati buhraan se samna hone ki bina par Northern Rock ko himayat ki zaroorat thi. Sir Richard Branson ke Virgin Group ne bank ko qaumi milkiyat qarar dene se qabl mustard kardah bank ke liye boli lagai thi. 2010 mein jab woh qaumi milkiyat mein liya gaya, maujoodah high street bank Northern Rock Public Limited ko 'bure bank' Northern Rock (Asset Management) se juda kar diya gaya. Virgin ne sirf Northern Rock ke 'achhe bank' ko khareeda hai, na ke Asset Management company ko."
