{
  "flores_passage": "Journal Science mein jumeraat ko shaya hui aik tahqeeq mein Ecuadoori Galapagos jazeere mein parindon ki nayi qism ke janam lene ki ittela di gayi hai. Wilayat-e-Mutahidda ki Princeton University aur Sweden ki Uppsala University ke muhaqqiqeen ne report kiya ke faqat do naslon mein nayi anwaa ka irtiqa hua, go ke khayal tha is amal ne is se zyada waqt liya, yeh irtiqa desi Darwin finch, Geospiza fortis, aur bahar se aayi cactus finch, Geospiza conirostris ke ma-bain breeding se hua."
