{
  "flores_passage": "Halanke aik tajurbati teeka Ebola se hone waali sharah-e-amwaat mein takhfeef karne waala maaloom padta hai, lekin abhi tak koi bhi dawa waazeh taur par maujoodah infection ke ilaaj ke liye mauzoon nahin paayi gayi hai. Aik antibody cocktail ZMapp ne ibtida mein is maidan mein umeed ki shama roshan ki hai lekin rasmi tahqeeq se pata chala ke yeh itna faayeda mand nahin tha jitna maut ko rokne ke liye matloob tha. PALM trial mein ZMapp ne control ka kaam kiya, yaani science daanon ne is ka istemaal baseline ke taur par kiya, aur is ke deegar teen ilaajon ka mawaazna kiya."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Hawai jahaaz ka rukh Irkutsk ki taraf kar diya gaya tha aur is ko daakhli daste chala rahe thay. Tafteesh ke liye aik inquiry tashkeel di gayi thi - IL-76 1970 ki dahayi se roosi aur soviet afwaaj ka aik bada mukawwin raha hai, aur roos mein yeh pichhle maah aik sangeen haadse se do-chaar ho chuka hai. 7 October ko udaan bharte hi engine tayyare se juda ho gaya lekin koi atlaaf nahin hua. Is haadse ke baad roos ne IL-76 tayyaron ko khidmat se bartaraf kar diya."
