{
  "flores_passage": "America ke sadar, George W. Bush 16 November ki subah Singapore pahunch kar aik hafta taweel Asia ke daure ka aaghaaz kiya. Is ka isteqbaal Singapore ke naayeb wazeer-e-azam Wong Kan Seng ki jaanib se kiya gaya aur Singapore ke wazeer-e-azam Lee Hsien Loong ke saath tijarat aur dahshat gardi ke umoor par baat cheet hui. Darmiyani muddat ke intikhabat mein bhari shikast khaane ke baad, Bush ne naazreen ko Asia mein tijarat mein tausee karne ke baare mein bataya."
