{
  "flores_passage": "Sabhi log auraton ke rings ki shamooliyat ke haami nahin thay. 2004 ke Olympic silver medalist Amir Khan ne kaha, \"Zaati taur par mera khayal hai ke khwateen ko ladna nahin chahiye, yeh mera nuqta-e-nazar hai.\" Apne saabiqa tabsiron ke bawajood unhon ne kaha ke woh London mein munaqid hone wale 2012 ke Olympics khelon mein bartanwi muqabla baazon ki himayat karenge."
