{
  "flores_passage": "Singapore rehne ke liye aam taur se aik mehfooz muqaam hai aur yahan aamad-o-raft bahut aasaan hai aur tum yahan aamad ke baad koi bhi cheez khareed sakte ho. Lekin \"oonche ilaaqon\" mein rakha jaana jo ke khat-e-istewa se kuch degree shumaal ki jaanib hi hai, aap ko hiddat (hamesha) aur sakht dhoop (jab aasman saaf ho, bahut hi kam aisa hota hai) donon ka samna karna pade ga."
