{
  "flores_passage": "Zyada tar mandiron mein november ke aakhir se may ke wast tak salana festival manaye jaate hain, jo har aik mandir ke salana calendar ke hisaab se alag alag hote hain. Mandir ke tehwaron mein se zyada tar mandir ki saalgirah ka hissa ya sadarati devta ki saalgirah ya mandir se munsalik kisi bhi doosre bade waqiye ke taur par manaya jaata hai. Kerala ke dilchasp mandiron ke mele dekhne ke laiq hain, is mein sajaye huye haathion ka juloos nikala jaata hai, mandir ka band baaja saath chalta hai, aur deegar taqreebaat barguzar ki jaati hain."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Bhook mitane ke liye supermarket se khana kharidna umooman kifayati hota hai- khana pakane ke liye mawaqe na milne par sirf taiyar shuda khano par hi iktefa karna padta hai. Takseeri andaz mein supermarkets taiyar shuda khane ki bahut si qismein farokht karte hain- yahan tak ke khana garam karne ke liye kuch to microwave oven ya deegar wasail bhi faraham karte hain. Kuch mumalik ya kuch qism ki dukanon mein kisi khas jagah par kam az kam aik restaurant maujood hota hai, jo aksar kuch ghair rasmi aur sasta hota hai."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "First ya business class mein parwaaz karne ka khula raasta yeh hai ke is imtiyaz ke liye zar ki aik moti gaddi nikaal pheenko (ya behtar hoga ke aap apni company ke zariye is ki adaygi karwayen). Taaham, yeh sasta nahin hai: angothay ke seedhay usool ke mutabiq, aap business class ke liye aam economy class se chaar guna zyada aur first class ke liye gyarah guna zyada adaygi karne ki tawaqqo kar sakte hain! Aam baat karein to karobar ya aik jagah se doosri jagah ke liye bara-e-raast parwaazon ke first class ke liye chhoot par ghaur karne ki bhi wajah nahin hai. Airlines companiyan jaanti hain ke hawai safar karne wala makhsoos group kahin bhi aaram-deh tareeqay se jaldi pahunchne ke liye zyada dollar dene ke liye tayyar rehta hai, to un par isi ke mutabiq charge karti hain."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Grand Waadi mein halqay se neeche camp karne ke liye backcountry se ijaazat leni padti hai. Ijaazat naame waadi ki hifaazat tak mahdood hain, aur ibtidai mahine se chaar maah qabl hi mahine ki pehli tareekh ko muhaiya ho jaate hain. Is taur par May mein ibtida ki kisi bhi tareekh ke liye backcountry permit 1 January se muhaiya hogi. Sab se maqbool ilaaqon ki jagah, jaisa ke Phantom Ranch se muttasil Bright Angel Campground, umooman reservation khulne ki pehli tareekh par mosool hone waali darkhwaston se bhar jaati hai. Permits ki aik mahdood taadaad walk-in darkhwaston ke liye reserve hai jo pehle aao, pehle pao ki buniyaad par mayassar hon gi."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Jazeera Hong Kong ke naam se Hong Kong khitte ka naam pada hai aur yeh woh jagah hai jise bahut saare sayyah apni siyaahat ka markaz samajhte hain. Imaraton ki qatarain jo Hong Kong ki skyline tarteeb deti hain aik chamakte huye bar chart ki soorat ikhtiyar kar chuki hain jo Victoria Harbour ke paanion ki maujoodgi mein ayan hota hai. Hong Kong ka behtareen nazara karne ke liye jazeera ko chhodo aur is ke bilmuqabil Kowloon waterfront par jao. Hong Kong jazeere ki shahri tameerat ki aik kaseer tadaad ki bharmar shumali saahil ke saath maujood qabil-e-istemaal banayi gayi zameen par hai. Yeh woh jagah hai jise Bartanwi samrajion ne apna bana liya tha aur isi tarah agar aap ilaaqe ke nau-abadiyati maazi ka saboot talash kar rahe hain, to is ki shuruaat karne ke liye yeh aik achi jagah hai."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Chunke Montevideo, khat-e-istewa ke junoob mein hai, yahan mausam-e-garma hota hai jab shumali nisf kurray mein sardi hoti hai aur isi tarah mukhalif bhi aisa hi hota hai. Montevideo zaili-madareen mein hai; garmiyon ke mahino mein, 30 degree centigrade se zaid darja-e-hararat aam hain. Mausam-e-sarma hairat-angez taur par thanda ho sakta hai: darja-e-hararat kabhi kabhaar munjamid point se neeche chala jata hai, lekin hawa aur nami thermometer par nazar aane wali thand se mausam ko kahin zyada sard bana deti hai. “Barsaat” aur “khushk” mausam ke liye koi waqt muqarrar nahin: barish ki miqdar saara saal lag bhag yaksaan rehti hai."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Kuchh tehwaron ke liye, haazreen ki kaseer taadaad jo mauseeqi ke tehwaron mein thi, unhon ne wahin parao daalne ka faisla kiya aur zyada tar haazreen ne ise tajurbe ka aik bada hissa gardana. Agar aap action ko bilkul qareeb se dekhna chahte hain to aap ko mauseeqi ke qareeb camping ke muqaam par jagah paane ke liye jaldi jaana hoga. Yaad rakhein ke asal stage par mauseeqi ka program bhale hi khatm ho gaya ho, lekin wahan festival ke bahut se hisson mein mauseeqi der raat tak bajti rahe gi. Kuchh festival mein family waalon aur chhote bachchon ke qiyaam ki khusoosi jaghein hoti hain."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Paris ke baashinde khud gharz, ghair mohazab aur maghroor hone ki haisiyat se shohrat rakhte hain. Jab yeh aksar aik ghalat muta-assab nazariya hai, Paris mein jaane ka sab se behtareen tareeqa achha rawaiya pesh karna aur aise shakhs ki tarah amal karna hai jis ki parwarish achhi hui ho. Yeh cheez safar ko qabil-e-lihaaz had tak aasan bana degi. Agar aap kuch buniyaadi tawaza dikhayen to Paris ke baashindon ki naagahani berukhi bahut jald ud jaati hai."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Jab doosre tumhara saamaan le ja rahe hon to apne bags par nazar rakho khususan bain-ul-aqwami sarhadon ko uboor karte waqt. Tum pao ge ke tumhare ilm ke baghair tum ko drug carrier qaraar de diya gaya hai. Is bana par tum khaasi mushkil se do-chaar ho sakte ho. Is mein waiting line bhi hoti hai, is liye ke baghair kisi ittela ke soonghne wale kutton ka kisi bhi waqt istemaal kiya ja sakta hai. Kuch mumalik mein pehli baar jurm sar-zad karne walon ke liye bhi nihayat zalimana saza maujood hai; un mein 10 saalon tak jail ya maut ki saza shamil hai- lawaris bags choron ke nishane par hote hain aur bomb ke khatraat se chaukanna hukkam ki is taraf nigah par sakti hai."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Duniya mein 5000 mukhtalif zabaanein boli jaati hain jin mein bees se zyada aisi hain jin ko 50 million se zyada log bolte hain. Likhe alfaaz ba-nisbat bole gaye alfaaz ke zyada qaabil-e-fehem hain. Ye bil-khusoos khitaabaat par sadiq hai jin ka durust talaffuz aksar dushwaar hota hai. Bahut saare mukammal aqwaam English mukammal rawaani se bolte hain aur aap tawaqqo kar sakte hain ke hatta ke is se zyada ke paas mahdood ilm hota hai, khaas taur par chhoti umar ke log. Tasawwur karein ke aap koi Maankoonian, Bostoonian, Jamaikan aur Sydneysider hain aur Toronto ke kisi restoraan mein aik mez par baith kar ashaaiya kha rahe hon. Wo aik doosre ka apne aabaayi shahron ke alag alag lehje aur muqaami boli mein kahi gayi kahaniyon se dil behla rahe hain."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Visa ke process ke liye registration aik izaafi zaroorat hai. Kuch mumalik mein, aap ko muqami hukkam ke paas apni maujoodgi aur jahan aap qiyaam pazeer hain us jagah ka pata darj karana hota hai. Is ke liye muqami police ka form pur karne ya immigration ke daftar par jaane ki zaroorat par sakti hai. Bahut se mumalik mein aise qanoon ke saath, muqami hotel indraaj ka intezaam karenge (koshish karein ke poochh lein); deegar muamlaat mein faqat un afraad ko register karne ki zaroorat hai jo tourists ke qiyaam ki jagahon se bahar qiyaam karte hain."
}

{
  "flores_passage": "Agarche aap ko bataur sayyah ya karobar ke waaste makhsoos mamaalik ke mukhtasar daure ke liye veeze ki zaroorat nahin padti, lekin aik bain-ul-aqwami taalib-e-ilm ki haisiyat se wahan jaane ke liye aam taur par wahan mahaz aik tafreehi sayyah ke bataur jaane se kahin zyada taweel qiyaam ki zaroorat hoti hai. Bataur-e-aam kisi ghair mulk mein taweel muddat tak qiyaam ke liye tumhein peshgi veeza haasil karna laazim hai. Talba ke veezon ke liye aam sayahati ya karobari veezon ki nisbat umooman mukhtalif taqaaze aur darkhwast ke tareeq-e-kaar hote hain. Zyada tar mamaalik mein jahan aap taleem haasil karna chahte hain wahan ke idare se offer letter aur kam se kam khud ke liye pehle taleemi saal ke ikhrajat ke waaste fund ke saboot ki zaroorat hogi. Tafseeli muqtaziyat ke liye mutalliqa idara ya us mulk ke immigration department se jahan tum study karna chahte ho tafseeli sharait ke liye rabt karo."
}
